      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROXY KEEPING (8) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors three starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (17.26) at this track over 300m. Deserves serious consideration. REGENCY BOY (1) goes very well at the course and distance with four wins and a placing from eight starts. Below best last time at this track (17.35) in a Free For All, finishing a 7 length sixth. Looks well placed here and among the chances. REGGAE MELODY (2) was a slick 17.11 winner of a Grade 6 at this track last start. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. BOILER MAKER (6) is a last-start placegetter and was not beaten too far - in the mix again.",
